$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 CS {
  coords 3268.667 32.36 691.859
  m_sTitle "Comsig"
  m_sTextData "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
  "• HQ - 31HQ"\
  "• 1SEC - 31Alpha"\
  "• 2SEC - 31Bravo"\
  "• WEP - 31Charlie"\
  ""\
  "<h2>FREQ/CHAN</h2>"\
  "• Platoon net - 42hz"\
  ""\
  "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
  "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
  "• <b>Challenge:</b> Dingus | <b>Password:</b> sasuage"\
  "• Running password: 78"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 5
 }
 EF {
  coords 3268.667 32.36 691.859
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Enemy forces consist of approximately a platoon of FIA light infantry occupying the barnyard at Parallel. The position was previously cleared by Canadian forces before being reoccupied by the FIA during ongoing fighting in the surrounding area."\
  ""\
  "If we take too long to dislodge the FIA from the area, we risk making contact with potentially additional FIA forces moving into the barnyard. We should move with haste."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• No armed or armoured vehicles have been spotted in the area."\
  "• The FIA have reoccupied a previous position. Expect the barnyard to contain established defensive positions and fortifications."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 FF {
  coords 3268.667 32.36 691.859
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are <b>C Company, 3rd Battalion, Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry (3 PPCLI)</b>, consisting of 28 personnel. We are currently positioned approximately 200m north of the barnyard at Parallel, preparing to conduct our assault."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• We have no vehicles or supporting troops available."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• No resupply or additional equipment is available."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS {
  coords 3268.667 32.36 691.859
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Conduct a <b>HASTY ASSAULT</b> to <b>DISLODGE</b> the FIA forces occupying the barnyard at Parallel."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "An FIA platoon has manoeuvred into the barnyard at Parallel and reoccupied a position previously cleared by Canadian forces. From here, they have begun harassing Canadian forces operating along our flank and disrupting ongoing operations in the area."\
  ""\
  "We are to move quickly and assault the barnyard before the FIA can further establish themselves. <b>CLEAR</b> all hostile forces from the position and <b>SECURE</b> the barnyard, restoring control of the area and allowing friendly operations to continue uninterrupted."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 SIT {
  coords 3268.667 32.36 691.859
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2> "\
  "DTL: 08/12/2023, 1335hrs, Parallel, Zarichne, Ruha. "\
  "Weather: Heavy rain, moderate fog, sightlines just over 1km+, no forecast of change."\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "Canadian forces have been conducting operations throughout the area, clearing key positions and pushing FIA forces away from their lines of advance. Earlier in the fighting, the barnyard at Parallel was cleared and left as an uncontested position as Canadian forces continued their operations elsewhere."\
  ""\
  "With Canadian forces tied up in fighting across the surrounding area, an FIA platoon managed to manoeuvre into the area undetected and reoccupy the barnyard. From their newly established position, they have begun harassing Canadian forces operating along the flank and disrupting ongoing operations."\
  ""\
  "The FIA presence has quickly become a threat to the wider Canadian advance. A Canadian platoon has now been tasked with a hasty assault to dislodge the FIA and regain control of the barnyard before they can further disrupt operations in the area."\
  ""
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}